{"id":42813,"date":"2025-06-24T11:47:12","date_gmt":"2025-06-24T10:47:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=42813"},"modified":"2026-08-24T06:55:38","modified_gmt":"2026-08-24T05:55:38","slug":"6-cascatas-trail-running-2025","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/6-cascatas-trail-running-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"6 Cascatas Trail Running 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A Trail4U ir\u00e1 organizar a 30 de Novembro de 2025 pelas 09h00 horas o 6 Cascatas Trail Running, em Cheleiros, concelho de Mafra. O 6 Cascatas Trail Running \u00e9 uma prova de Trail Running, corrida pedestre em Natureza, com tr\u00eas provas, Trail Longo (TL) K24, Trail Curto (TC) 14 e Caminhada<br>Com partida e chegada na localidade de Cheleiros, Concelho de Mafra, Distrito de Lisboa, visa a promo\u00e7\u00e3o e divulga\u00e7\u00e3o tur\u00edstica e ambiental da regi\u00e3o e da promo\u00e7\u00e3o do desporto em meio natural.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>A prova 6 Cascatas Trail Running encontra-se inserida dos circuitos:<br>\u27a2 Mafra Trail Running Series<br>\u27a2 Merrell Trail Running Series<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":42814,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[33,727],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-42813","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-cheleiros-mafra","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/pop_6u98875883.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.c